  "uiTestNames": [
    "IME draft survives unrelated projection and commits once; update, replace and disposal preserve lifetimes",
    "when, repeat and State writes update existing inputs; replaced callbacks cannot mutate the new lifetime",
    "child slot preserves native trigger events, focus return and portal theme without a host CSS reset",
    "invalid union mode and executable URL become renderer diagnostics; corrected input recovers",
    "native Calendar date values round trip and external null clears the selection",
    "missing inputs defer native mount and invalid inputs disable the retained control until recovery",
    "catalog fixtures account for each upstream family and public component binding",
    "all 66 JSON examples render their expected UI through installed package exports",
    "gallery Action, Korean input, Query and rejected JSON use the live View",
    "modal child triggers, menu portals and selection use native controls",
    "host namespace exposes calendar and chart parts inside their native scoped contexts",
    "gallery panels use the viewport and keep the inspector scrollable on desktop and narrow screens",
    "Accordion, Collapsible and Tabs change both Core State and visible content",
    "Checkbox, Switch, Radio and Slider forward user input to Core State",
    "Toggle, Toggle Group, Input OTP and Native Select keep controlled values",
    "Carousel navigation moves the native Embla track",
    "Resizable drag and Sidebar toggling change the layout",
    "Navigation Menu and Questionnaire expose their next action through native controls",
    "Code Block copies content, Message Scroller returns to the end and Trace expands",
    "command IME commits the final Korean value once (immediate final input)",
